<script setup lang="ts">import { Link,useForm } from '@inertiajs/vue3';import { Plus,Trash2 } from '@lucide/vue';import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button';import { Input } from '@/components/ui/input';import { Label } from '@/components/ui/label';type Option={value:string;label:string};type Presentation={id:string;label:string;minimum_sale_price:number|null};type List={name:string;type:string;starts_at:string|null;ends_at:string|null;is_default:boolean;is_active:boolean;items:{presentation_id:string;price:number;minimum_price:number|null}[]};const props=defineProps<{submitUrl:string;method:'post'|'put';types:Option[];presentations:Presentation[];priceList?:List}>();const form=useForm({name:props.priceList?.name??'',type:props.priceList?.type??'retail',starts_at:props.priceList?.starts_at??'',ends_at:props.priceList?.ends_at??'',is_default:props.priceList?.is_default??false,is_active:props.priceList?.is_active??true,items:props.priceList?.items.map(i=>({...i}))??[{presentation_id:props.presentations[0]?.id??'',price:0,minimum_price:props.presentations[0]?.minimum_sale_price??null}]});const add=()=>form.items.push({presentation_id:props.presentations[0]?.id??'',price:0,minimum_price:props.presentations[0]?.minimum_sale_price??null});const syncMin=(line:any)=>{line.minimum_price=props.presentations.find(p=>p.id===line.presentation_id)?.minimum_sale_price??null};const submit=()=>props.method==='post'?form.post(props.submitUrl):form.put(props.submitUrl);</script>
<template><form class="grid gap-5" @submit.prevent="submit"><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="grid gap-2"><Label>Nombre</Label><Input v-model="form.name" required/></div><div class="grid gap-2"><Label>Tipo</Label><select v-model="form.type" class="h-9 rounded-md border bg-transparent px-3 text-sm"><option v-for="type in types" :key="type.value" :value="type.value">{{type.label}}</option></select></div><div class="grid gap-2"><Label>Vigente desde</Label><Input v-model="form.starts_at" type="datetime-local"/></div><div class="grid gap-2"><Label>Vigente hasta</Label><Input v-model="form.ends_at" type="datetime-local"/></div></div><div class="flex gap-6"><label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm"><input v-model="form.is_default" type="checkbox"/> Lista predeterminada</label><label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm"><input v-model="form.is_active" type="checkbox"/> Activa</label></div><section class="grid gap-3"><div class="flex justify-between"><div><h2 class="font-semibold">Precios por presentación</h2><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">El precio mínimo se conserva junto al precio ofrecido.</p></div><Button type="button" variant="outline" size="sm" @click="add"><Plus/> Producto</Button></div><div v-for="(line,index) in form.items" :key="index" class="grid items-end gap-3 rounded-lg border p-3 md:grid-cols-[1fr_12rem_12rem_auto]"><div class="grid gap-2"><Label>Presentación</Label><select v-model="line.presentation_id" class="h-9 rounded-md border bg-transparent px-3 text-sm" @change="syncMin(line)"><option v-for="p in presentations" :key="p.id" :value="p.id">{{p.label}}</option></select></div><div class="grid gap-2"><Label>Precio (COP)</Label><Input v-model.number="line.price" type="number" min="0"/></div><div class="grid gap-2"><Label>Mínimo (COP)</Label><Input v-model.number="line.minimum_price" type="number" min="0"/></div><Button type="button" variant="ghost" size="icon" :disabled="form.items.length===1" @click="form.items.splice(index,1)"><Trash2/></Button></div></section><p v-if="Object.keys(form.errors).length" class="text-sm text-destructive">{{Object.values(form.errors)[0]}}</p><div class="flex justify-end gap-2"><Button variant="outline" as-child><Link href="/pricing">Cancelar</Link></Button><Button type="submit" :disabled="form.processing">Guardar lista</Button></div></form></template>
